{
  "id": "shorter-text",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Kısa Olan",
    "en": "The Shorter One"
  },
  "difficulty": 1,
  "language": "rust",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.rs",
  "solution": "solution.rs",
  "timeout_sec": 45,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`if y.len() < x.len() { y } else { x }`",
      "en": "`if y.len() < x.len() { y } else { x }`"
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```rust\nfn shorter<'a>(x: &'a str, y: &'a str) -> &'a str {\n    if y.len() < x.len() { y } else { x }\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"{}\", shorter(\"abc\", \"de\"));\n}\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```rust\nfn shorter<'a>(x: &'a str, y: &'a str) -> &'a str {\n    if y.len() < x.len() { y } else { x }\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"{}\", shorter(\"abc\", \"de\"));\n}\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "rust_test",
      "tests": [
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(shorter(\"abc\", \"de\"), \"de\");",
          "label": {
            "tr": "ikincisi",
            "en": "the second"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(shorter(\"a\", \"de\"), \"a\");",
          "label": {
            "tr": "birincisi",
            "en": "the first"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(shorter(\"ab\", \"cd\"), \"ab\");",
          "label": {
            "tr": "eşit",
            "en": "equal"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
